sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Engineer
  participant API as Automation API
  participant Queue as Job Queue
  participant Worker as Restricted Worker
  participant Vault
  participant Device as Network device
  participant Evidence
  Engineer->>API: Submit reviewed intent reference and operation
  API->>API: Validate identity, scope, and schema
  API->>Queue: Enqueue non-secret job reference
  API-->>Engineer: Return job ID
  Queue->>Worker: Deliver job
  Worker->>Vault: Request scoped short-lived credential
  Vault-->>Worker: Issue credential
  Worker->>Device: Verify identity and collect pre-checks
  Device-->>Worker: Configuration and operational facts
  Worker->>Device: Apply approved operation when authorized
  Device-->>Worker: Protocol response
  Worker->>Device: Read configuration and operational state
  Device-->>Worker: Post-change facts
  Worker->>Evidence: Store sanitized evidence and result
  Worker->>Vault: Revoke or release credential
  API-->>Engineer: Return status and evidence reference
